+
+The accepted physical evidence is deliberately owned outside this implementation
+Story by `TASK-260715-gyg51r` and `TASK-260715-135rr8`; duplicating those manual
+gate tasks here would weaken provenance. No new research task or diagram is
+needed for this synthesis.
+
